Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Certificate Validation Failures
Symptoms: Managed clusters showing as unavailable or disconnected

Solution:

# Check certificate validity
openssl x509 -in ~/cluster-certs/ca-cert.pem -noout -dates

# Verify certificate chain
openssl verify -CAfile ~/cluster-certs/ca-cert.pem ~/cluster-certs/managed1-cert.pem

# Recreate certificates if expired
# Follow Subtask 1.2 to generate new certificates
Issue 2: TLS Handshake Failures
Symptoms: Connection timeouts or SSL handshake errors

Solution:

# Check network connectivity
telnet multicloud-console.apps.hub-cluster.example.com 443

# Verify cipher suite compatibility
openssl s_client -connect multicloud-console.apps.hub-cluster.example.com:443 -tls1_2

# Update cipher suite configuration if needed
Issue 3: Policy Deployment Failures
Symptoms: Policies not propagating to managed clusters

Solution:

# Check placement rule status
oc get placementrule test-tls-placement -o yaml

# Verify cluster labels and selectors
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Check policy controller logs
oc logs -n open-cluster-management deployment/governance-policy-propagator
